      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Naubinway%2C_Michigan",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Naubinway remains the largest commercial fishing port in Michigan’s Upper Peninsula.",
